WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Unstaked your NEAR? It might still be waiting for you.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Paste your NEAR account. No wallet connection needed.

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:15.550
FOUND checks what’s ready to withdraw, straight from the chain.

00:00:17.150 --> 00:00:23.300
Then open the official app. Only you approve the withdrawal.

00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:28.240
One simple check covers LiNEAR and Meta Pool.

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:36.860
Our LiNEAR snapshot found 538 accounts with NEAR waiting.

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:42.481
FOUND. Find the NEAR you left behind.
